MODEL INFORMATION:

  NUMBER OF PARAMETERS
    Outcome Models:         47
    Generated Parameters:   1
    Predictor Models:       0

  FACTORS
    Level-2:                b_0j b_1j b_2j g_0j g_1j g_2j l_j w_j

  DEFINED VARIABLES
    [1]  sleep_lag = sleep.lag - b_0j 
    [2]  pain_lag = pain.lag - g_0j 

  MODELS

   between:
    [1]  b_0j ~ Intercept@b_0
    [2]  b_1j ~ Intercept@b_1
    [3]  b_2j ~ Intercept@b_2
    [4]  g_0j ~ Intercept@g_0
    [5]  g_1j ~ Intercept@g_1
    [6]  g_2j ~ Intercept@g_2
    [7]  l_j ~ Intercept@l_0
    [8]  w_j ~ Intercept@w_0
    [9]  b_0j b_1j b_2j g_0j g_1j g_2j l_j w_j <-> b_0j b_1j b_2j g_0j g_1j 
                 g_2j l_j w_j 

   within:
   [10]  pain ~ g_0j@1 (pain_lag)*g_1j@1 (sleep_lag)*g_2j@1
   [11]  var(pain) ~ w_j@1
   [12]  sleep ~ b_0j@1 (sleep_lag)*b_1j@1 (pain_lag)*b_2j@1 (sleep_lag*pain_lag)@b_3
   [13]  var(sleep) ~ l_j@1 pain_lag@a
   [14]  pain <-> sleep

  GENERATED PARAMETERS
    [1]  var_ratio = exp(a)


